# P81 on Android: a sheet asked for by the second window must appear over the second window. Buttons pressed by their text, so no coordinates.
# Pass: the final capture is window B (its own activity) with "sheet from window B" over it; "sheet from window B" over window A is the defect.
# Written 2026-10-20 on swift-cross-ui-tablet36.
